.TH MSHELL 1.SH NAMEmshell \- a menu shell.SH SYNOPSIS\fBmshell\fRmenufile.SH DESCRIPTION\fBmshell\fRshows a menu read from\fImenufile\fR,\fRone entry to a line written\fBlabel,command\fR,\fReach numbered on the screen.  Typing a number runs that entry's command;control-C leaves..nf    List the directory,dir -e    Free space,free.fi.SH NOTESNeeds Microware's\fBcio\fR.\fRIt hands each command to a module called\fBshell\fR,\fRthe one your own OS-9 brings..SH SEE ALSOgshell